        "Title": "The Old Friend",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110714027666",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 2e1a30c5-b1e0-4984-b3f4-67f01f9ebfef).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47,\rWelcome to Japan. Your primary target is Carlton Smith, someone I know you may share a history with but don&apos;t let that get in the way of the job because our client wants him elimiminated for evading their capture. Smith should be found in the morgue where he is being hidden away by hospital director Nakamura until he can safely show his face again. That brings me on to your two secondary targets, Akira Nakamura and Justin Speer who helped Smith evade capture.\rGood luck 47.",
